; The workspace-wide env stanzas live here (NOT in dune-project: profiles
; are not dune-project fields — see commit e9c8d95 and d4d31a5).
;
; [vsa-debug] is the sanctioned home for EVERYTHING diagnostic (AGENTS.md
; §6): temporary debug prints, env-gated instrumentation, profiling
; drivers, and analysis forensics. Select it with
;
;   dune build --profile vsa-debug <target>
;   dune exec  --profile vsa-debug <target> -- <args>
;
; Production builds (the default `dev` profile, and `release`) carry none
; of it: the [enabled_if (= %{profile} vsa-debug)] stanzas compile to
; nothing there, and cbat_vsa's per-stage profiling counters link the
; no-op adapter instead.
(env
 (vsa-debug
  (flags
   (:standard -g -alert -deprecated))
  (ocamlopt_flags
   (:standard -O3))))
